  "description": "L10NSharp.Windows.Forms is a .NET localization library for Windows Forms applications. It collects strings which need localization when your application first runs and saves them in a XLIFF file. It can also dynamically collect strings at runtime.",
  "id": "L10NSharp.Windows.Forms",
